            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Development of a research instrument for environment-minded\tbehaviour of children aged 9 to 12 years. Name of residence / group / several hypothetical situations with environmental aspects and-or values and belief aspects in which the  pupil has to choose for \"do\" or \"don't\" on a 4 points scale /  questions about knowledge of recycling, chemical waste, use of bottle bank, wastepaper / own influence on environmental problems /  environmental attitude of parents, separation of waste and refuse,  use of energy and water. Background variables: basic characteristics/ residence/ occupation/employment/ organizational membership</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
